<title>DENMARK: Unidanmark signs 1 bln dlr Euronote deal.</title>
<headline>Unidanmark signs 1 bln dlr Euronote deal.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Unidanmark A/S said it signed a one billion dollar Euronote programme on Tuesday with Merrill Lynch International as arranger.</p>
</text>
